msgid "A reminder %d hours before each task."
msgstr "每个任务开始前 %d 小时发送提醒。"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:460
msgid "A request made less than this many days before the task starts, but not at short notice, uses the medium-notice answer time. Default 7."
msgstr "在任务开始前不到这么多天提出、但不属于短时通知的请求，使用中等通知的答复时间。默认 7。"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:444
msgid "A request made less than this many hours before the task starts uses the short-notice answer time. Default 48."
msgstr "在任务开始前不到这么多小时提出的请求，使用短时通知的答复时间。默认 48。"

#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:244
msgid "A role can have conditions in EventCrew > Settings: how many tasks of which roles a member has completed. Meeting them does not give the role. You are told, by Telegram and by email, the first time someone meets a role's conditions and the first time someone is given a role. /people, then ✅ Who may hold each role, lists who meets the conditions of each role."
msgstr "角色可以在 EventCrew > 设置 中设定条件：成员完成了哪些角色的多少个任务。满足条件并不会自动获得角色。当有人第一次满足某角色的条件，以及第一次被授予某角色时，你会通过 Telegram 和邮件收到通知。/people，然后 ✅ 谁可以担任各角色，会列出谁满足各角色的条件。"

#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:122
msgid "A role is a kind of job, for example Welcome or Clean. You set the roles in Settings: name, emoji, a short description, how many people, and when it starts and ends compared to the event."
msgstr "角色是一种工作，例如迎宾或清洁。你在“设置”中设定角色：名称、表情符号、简短说明、人数，以及相对活动的开始和结束时间。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:393
msgid "A role ticked \"Only people with this role\" (a DJ, a VJ, a ceremony leader) is shown only to people given that role, in the Crew app, in the bot and at the sales desk. Its tasks have no sign-up limit and are never posted on the Telegram group board. Give people the role on the People page, in the Crew app Admin tab, or with /people in the bot. With \"Add to every night\" ticked, every upcoming night gets one task of that role, including nights that already exist; unticking it later removes nothing."
msgstr "勾选了“仅限拥有此角色的人”的角色（DJ、VJ、仪式主持人）只会显示给被授予该角色的人，在团队应用、机器人和售票台中都是如此。其任务没有报名上限，也从不发到 Telegram 群的任务板上。可以在“人员”页面、团队应用的“管理”标签或机器人中用 /people 授予角色。勾选“每晚都加”后，每个即将到来的晚上都会有一个该角色的任务，包括已经存在的晚上；之后取消勾选不会删除任何内容。"

