msgid "Every link in it carries utm_source=eventcrew, utm_medium=email and utm_campaign=thanks-YYYY-MM-DD or missed-YYYY-MM-DD, so your shop’s and your site’s statistics can tell which sales came from these emails. The Roster page shows how many people opened a link."
msgstr "其中每个链接都带有 utm_source=eventcrew、utm_medium=email 和 utm_campaign=thanks-YYYY-MM-DD 或 missed-YYYY-MM-DD，这样你的商店和网站统计就能分辨哪些销售来自这些邮件。“名册”页面会显示有多少人打开了链接。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:1344
msgid "Every notification goes out as a designed HTML email with your logo on top and a button for whatever it is asking people to do — show a ticket, sign in, take an open slot. A plain-text copy travels with each one, so a mail client that will not show HTML still gets the whole message."
msgstr "每条通知都以设计好的 HTML 邮件发出，顶部是你的标志，并有一个按钮对应要人们做的事 — 出示票、登录、接手空缺名额。每封都附带纯文本副本，所以不显示 HTML 的邮件客户端也能收到完整消息。"

#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:159
msgid "Every send waits 10 minutes before anything goes out, whether an import or \"Send the rest now\" started it. Until then, Roster and the Admin tab show the time, how many get an email, and a \"Cancel sending\" button. Cancelling sends nothing; those tickets stay not sent. \"Send a test to me\" is not delayed."
msgstr "每次发送都会等待 10 分钟才发出，无论是导入还是“立即发送其余的”触发的。在此之前，“名册”和“管理”标签会显示时间、将收到邮件的人数，以及“取消发送”按钮。取消则不发送任何内容；这些票保持未发送状态。“发送测试给我”不会延迟。"

