#. translators: %s: the import email address
#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:202
msgid "Or email the Holvi ticket file (.xlsx or .csv) to %s. Send it from the email address you have in EventCrew; mail from any other address is not used. The tickets go to the next event, which must already have its tasks. Names typed in the message itself, one per line, go to that event’s guest list instead; write \"+2\" after a name for two plus-ones. Put an email address on the line too (Anna Virtanen <anna@example.com> +2) and the guest gets a ticket by email. Lines after a signature line (--) are ignored. A name already on the list is skipped. Within a few minutes you get an email saying what was added and what was skipped. If no email comes, add the names in EventCrew > Roster instead."
msgstr "或者把 Holvi 票文件（.xlsx 或 .csv）通过邮件发到 %s。请从你在 EventCrew 中的邮箱地址发送；其他地址发来的邮件不会被使用。票会进入下一个活动，该活动必须已经有任务。在邮件正文中写的名字（每行一个）则会进入该活动的嘉宾名单；在名字后写“+2”表示带两位同伴。在同一行写上邮箱地址（Anna Virtanen <anna@example.com> +2），嘉宾就会通过邮件收到票。签名分隔行（--）之后的内容会被忽略。已在名单上的名字会被跳过。几分钟内你会收到一封邮件，说明添加了什么、跳过了什么。如果没有收到邮件，请改在 EventCrew > 名册 中添加名字。"

