msgstr "报名门槛已开启：低于 %d%% 的成员不能报名新任务。/people 可以给他们发放一次性通行证。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:2217
msgid "The site can read the import mailbox itself every five minutes, instead of a mail poller on the mail server. Use JMAP if your host blocks the IMAP ports; many shared hosts do. A message is marked read and moved to the Imported or Rejected folder once it has been dealt with."
msgstr "网站可以每五分钟自行读取导入邮箱，代替邮件服务器上的邮件轮询程序。如果你的主机屏蔽了 IMAP 端口（很多共享主机都会），请使用 JMAP。消息处理完毕后会被标记为已读，并移到“已导入”或“已拒绝”文件夹。"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1572
msgid "The site did not accept the secret. If the secret is not in the address, your host may remove the secret header."
msgstr "网站没有接受该密钥。如果密钥不在地址中，你的主机可能会移除密钥请求头。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:1900
