#: templates/admin/settings.php:2163
msgid "When a mailed list has an .xlsx or .csv file attached, the file is read instead of the mail text. Its first row must hold the column headers of one of these formats. In a header field, separate accepted header texts with \"|\", and join columns with \"+\", as in \"Etunimi + Sukunimi\". Upper and lower case do not matter."
msgstr "当邮寄的名单附有 .xlsx 或 .csv 文件时，会读取该文件而不是邮件文本。文件的第一行必须是这些格式之一的列标题。在标题字段中，用“|”分隔可接受的标题文本，用“+”连接列，例如“Etunimi + Sukunimi”。大小写不影响。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:1535
msgid "When every organizer gets the preview email. With no previous event, or a previous event with no end time, the second choice is used. A preview time that is not before the sending time sends the preview one day before the sending. Times are in the site time zone and are checked once an hour."
msgstr "每位组织者收到预览邮件的时间。没有上一个活动，或上一个活动没有结束时间时，使用第二个选项。不早于发送时间的预览时间，会让预览在发送前一天发出。时间以网站时区为准，每小时检查一次。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:574
msgid "When notifications go out"
msgstr "通知何时发出"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:880
msgid "When on, an at-risk member who taps Join is asked to talk to you instead. New and good-standing members are never affected."
msgstr "开启后，有风险的成员点击“加入”时，会被请求先与你沟通。新成员和信誉良好的成员从不受影响。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:532
msgid "When on, the board is re-posted into the group at each lead time below (deleting the previous one), so it resurfaces instead of sitting buried. It reaches the whole group and cannot be muted per person."
msgstr "开启后，任务板会在下面每个提前时间重新发到群里（并删除上一个），这样它会重新出现，而不是被淹没。它会发给整个群，不能按个人设为静音。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:500
msgid "When someone asks to take over another person’s task, the holder decides. If the holder does not answer by the deadline, they keep the task. These numbers set the deadline."
msgstr "当有人请求接手别人的任务时，由任务持有人决定。如果持有人在截止时间前没有答复，任务就仍归他们。这些数字决定截止时间。"

#: src/Support/EventTaskMover.php:70
msgid "When the start time changes, every task of this event moves by the same amount."
msgstr "开始时间变化时，此活动的每个任务都会移动相同的时长。"

#: templates/admin/settings.php:1955
msgid "When this is on, the bot answers messages that are not commands with the help of a language model on a server you choose. Its API must accept OpenAI-style chat completions. In a private chat the bot answers every such message. In the group it answers only messages meant for the bot that it can answer, and stays silent otherwise. Changes (signing up for a task, leaving it, the guest list) always ask the person to confirm with a button first."
msgstr "开启后，机器人会借助你选择的服务器上的语言模型来回答非命令消息。其 API 必须支持 OpenAI 风格的 chat completions。在私聊中，机器人会回答每一条这样的消息。在群里，它只回答发给机器人且它能回答的消息，其他时候保持沉默。更改（报名任务、退出任务、嘉宾名单）总是会先请对方用按钮确认。"

#. translators: %d: minutes before the night's first task
#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:154
msgid "When you are signed up for the night's Organize task, you get the sales desk link %d minutes before the night's first task, with a button to the Admin tab. The welcome crew (people on tasks of a role marked \"Opens the sales desk\") get it once they are marked arrived. /door, then 💳 Sales desk, sends a new link any time. /door has buttons for the door list (who has a ticket) and the guest list."
msgstr "当你报名了当晚的“组织”任务时，你会在当晚第一个任务开始前 %d 分钟收到售票台链接，并附有一个通往“管理”标签的按钮。迎宾团队（所在任务的角色被标记为“打开售票台”的人）在被标记为已到场后收到它。/door，然后 💳 售票台，随时会发送新链接。/door 有门口名单（谁有票）和嘉宾名单的按钮。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:657
msgid "When you buy a ticket in our web shop, we take these details from the shop's order export: your name, your email address, and your order or ticket code. We also store the date of the event your ticket is for. We take nothing else from your order."
msgstr "当你在我们的网店购票时，我们会从商店的订单导出中获取这些信息：你的名字、你的邮箱地址，以及你的订单或票代码。我们还会保存你的票所对应活动的日期。我们不会从你的订单中获取其他任何信息。"

#: src/Support/WelcomeSender.php:432
msgid "When you sign up for a task, you get a free ticket for that night. Show it at the door. It is the first button in your sign-up confirmation, and /me tickets lists all your tickets."
msgstr "你报名任务后，会得到当晚的免费票。请在门口出示。它是你报名确认中的第一个按钮，/me tickets 会列出你所有的票。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:450
msgid "When you take a task, or spend a free-entry credit, we also email you your ticket: a QR code and a link to your ticket page. If that task or credit is cancelled after the ticket was sent, we email you that the ticket is cancelled."
msgstr "当你接下任务或使用免费入场积分时，我们还会通过邮件把票发给你：一个二维码和你的票页面链接。如果票发出后该任务或积分被取消，我们会发邮件告诉你票已取消。"

#. translators: %d: number of days
#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:413
msgid "When you use the bot, we keep a short log of which command or button you used: when, your crew record (or, if your Telegram account is not linked, its numeric identifier), whether it was a private or a group chat, the name of the command, a date if the command named one, and whether it worked. The log never contains what you wrote. The organizers use it to see how the bot is used and to find faults. Each entry is deleted after %d days."
msgstr "当你使用机器人时，我们会保留一份简短记录，记下你用了哪个命令或按钮：时间、你的团队记录（如果你的 Telegram 账户没有关联，则是它的数字标识）、是私聊还是群聊、命令名称、命令中提到的日期（如有），以及是否成功。记录中绝不包含你写的内容。组织者用它来了解机器人的使用情况并找出故障。每条记录会在 %d 天后删除。"

#: src/Support/PrivacyPolicy.php:686
msgid "When your ticket is added to our door list, we email you a thank-you message with your ticket: a QR code, your ticket code and a link to your ticket page. You show the QR code at the door. The legal basis is the same: it is necessary to give you the entry you paid for."
msgstr "当你的票被加入我们的门口名单时，我们会发给你一封附有票的感谢邮件：一个二维码、你的票代码以及你的票页面链接。你在门口出示二维码。法律依据相同：这是为你提供你已付费的入场所必需的。"

